# 10. Reset and Reproducibility Requirements

The application will be used by multiple student batches or training groups.

Therefore, resetting the environment must be straightforward.

The developer shall provide:

- Initial deployment script.
- Complete environment reset script.
- Database reset functionality.
- Flag regeneration functionality.
- Staff browser session reset.
- Log cleanup functionality.
- Docker Compose shutdown and cleanup instructions.

The reset procedure must restore the application to its original vulnerable state.

It must not require rebuilding the entire Docker image for every student attempt.

The developer should support independent instances for different students or teams.

A reset must not affect other running student instances.

